      "left_block_id": "v7en_b000173",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b000174",
      "joined_text": "In addition to his prison sentence, the court mandated that Tamayo serve three years of supervised release and pay restitution of US$700,474.97."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000002",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_examples-of-predicate-crimes_o020_l020_N000005",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_examples-of-predicate-crimes_o020_l020_N000006",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b000322",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b000323",
      "joined_text": "For example, correspondent banking is a business model that makes financial transactions possible between unrelated banks in different jurisdictions."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000003",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_consequences-of-financial-crime_o000_l020_N000039",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_consequences-of-financial-crime_o000_l020_N000040",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b000356",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b000357",
      "joined_text": "In extreme cases, repeat offenders risk disqualification from critical markets, loss of operating licenses, or entering into a deferred prosecution agreement whereby the offending entity agrees to fulfill certain requirements, such as an overhaul of the AML/CTF compliance program in exchange for the postponement of prosecution."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000004",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_consequences-of-financial-crime_o000_l020_N000047",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_consequences-of-financial-crime_o000_l020_N000048",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b000363",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b000364",
      "joined_text": "For example, in many European countries severe compliance failures can lead to temporary disqualification from holding senior roles, asset freezes, or travel restrictions."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000005",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_money-laundering-risks-associated-with-retail-and-commercial-banking_o000_l020_N000011",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_money-laundering-risks-associated-with-retail-and-commercial-banking_o000_l020_N000012",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b000501",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b000502",
      "joined_text": "These mules act as intermediaries, which makes it challenging for banks to trace the origin of the funds."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000006",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_money-laundering-risks-associated-with-retail-and-commercial-banking_o020_l020_N000010",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_money-laundering-risks-associated-with-retail-and-commercial-banking_o020_l020_N000011",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b000541",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b000542",
      "joined_text": "However, the guidance notes that, while their limited functionality and flexibility make them lower risk for money laundering, these restrictions might not fully deter potential terrorist financiers."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000007",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_corporate-and-investment-banking-risks_o000_l020_N000026",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_corporate-and-investment-banking-risks_o000_l020_N000027",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b000645",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b000646",
      "joined_text": "The use of shell companies and complex ownership structures can obscure the true beneficiaries of the transaction, making it difficult to identify potential money laundering risks."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000008",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_money-laundering-risks-associated-with-msbs-payment-service-providers-and-ecommerce_o000_l020_N000028",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_money-laundering-risks-associated-with-msbs-payment-service-providers-and-ecommerce_o000_l020_N000029",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b000735",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b000736",
      "joined_text": "Today, MSBs also serve small and medium-sized businesses that are not served by larger financial institutions."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000009",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_money-laundering-risks-associated-with-insurance-securities-brokerage-and-custodian-services_o000_l020_N000027",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_money-laundering-risks-associated-with-insurance-securities-brokerage-and-custodian-services_o000_l020_N000028",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b000818",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b000819",
      "joined_text": "Transactions can encompass a wide range of financial instruments, including transferable securities, moneymarket instruments, investment funds, options, futures, swaps, forward rate agreements, and other derivative contracts."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000010",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_money-laundering-risks-associated-with-cryptoassets-and-other-fintechs_o000_l020_N000036",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_money-laundering-risks-associated-with-cryptoassets-and-other-fintechs_o000_l020_N000037",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b000886",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b000887",
      "joined_text": "While CBDCs are stable by design, as they are directly backed by central banks and maintain parity with national currencies, weak AML and KYC regulations can pose financial crime risks."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000011",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_money-laundering-risks-associated-with-dnfbps_o000_l020_N000018",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_money-laundering-risks-associated-with-dnfbps_o000_l020_N000019",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b000936",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b000937",
      "joined_text": "Additionally, online gaming operators might inadvertently permit customers outside the jurisdiction to participate in gaming if IP spoofing occurs or geolocation safeguards fail, usually facilitated by users accessing the website or mobile application through a VPN."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000012",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_money-laundering-risks-associated-with-dnfbps_o000_l020_N000035",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_money-laundering-risks-associated-with-dnfbps_o000_l020_N000036",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b000943",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b000944",
      "joined_text": "For example, properties acquired by corporate entities, trusts, or nominees without a clear justification as to why they were not purchased directly by an individual are red flags."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000013",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_money-laundering-risks-associated-with-dnfbps_o020_l020_N000009",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_money-laundering-risks-associated-with-dnfbps_o020_l020_N000010",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b000965",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b000966",
      "joined_text": "A lack of due diligence in maintaining company records or supporting corporate governance processes could enable criminals to obscure UBO identities, unwittingly facilitating illicit activities."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000014",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_high-risk-business-sectors_o020_l020_N000004",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_high-risk-business-sectors_o020_l020_N000005",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b001022",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b001023",
      "joined_text": "Those transferors may owe the broker a debt, which they repay to the “remitter’s” payee as a third-party payment, or they may be a collaborative partner who charges the payee a service fee."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000015",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_global-afc-frameworks-governance-and-regulations_o000_l020_N000018",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_global-afc-frameworks-governance-and-regulations_o000_l020_N000019",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b001098",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b001099",
      "joined_text": "They issue recommendations that influence banking operations worldwide, from CDD to transaction screening for sanctions violations."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000016",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_financial-action-task-force_o000_l020_N000018",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_financial-action-task-force_o000_l020_N000019",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b001134",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b001135",
      "joined_text": "FATF then requires member jurisdictions to address any deficiencies and subjects them to post-assessment monitoring to ensure they address their issues."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000017",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_financial-action-task-force_o000_l020_N000047",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_financial-action-task-force_o000_l020_N000048",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b001147",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b001148",
      "joined_text": "Laws should protect financial institutions and their employees from liability and prohibit them from disclosing suspicious transactions."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000018",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_financial-action-task-force_o040_l020_N000014",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_financial-action-task-force_o040_l020_N000015",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b001196",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b001197",
      "joined_text": "This monitoring can include regular reports of improvements for jurisdictions that are already largely compliant and actively addressing the remaining few shortcomings."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000019",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_afc-guidance-from-other-organizations_o000_l020_N000009",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_afc-guidance-from-other-organizations_o000_l020_N000010",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b001363",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b001364",
      "joined_text": "Transparency International (TI) is a non-governmental organization committed to stopping corruption and promoting transparency, accountability, and integrity at both national and international levels."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000020",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_us-aml-cft-regulatory-landscape_o020_l020_N000002",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_us-aml-cft-regulatory-landscape_o020_l020_N000003",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b001489",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b001490",
      "joined_text": "If a financial institution is found in violation of US laws and regulations related to financial crime, these regulators can impose civil monetary penalties, forfeiture of proceeds, limitations on future business activities, and criminal charges against the bank or its officers."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000021",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_us-aml-cft-regulatory-landscape_o040_l020_N000027",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_us-aml-cft-regulatory-landscape_o040_l020_N000028",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b001548",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b001549",
      "joined_text": "To ensure the financial institution achieves this balance, it should abide by its management oversight and governance obligations."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000022",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_other-afc-regulations-that-impact-organizations_o000_l020_N000014",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_other-afc-regulations-that-impact-organizations_o000_l020_N000015",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b001636",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b001637",
      "joined_text": "For large companies and public entities, Sapin II introduced an obligation to have an anticorruption program meeting specific criteria."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000023",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_other-afc-regulations-that-impact-organizations_o000_l020_N000047",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_other-afc-regulations-that-impact-organizations_o000_l020_N000048",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b001650",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b001651",
      "joined_text": "Similar to Canada, Australia implements autonomous sanctions through the Autonomous Sanctions Act and the corresponding Autonomous Sanctions Regulations."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000024",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_other-laws-and-regulations-that-impact-organizations_o000_l020_N000026",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_other-laws-and-regulations-that-impact-organizations_o000_l020_N000027",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b001665",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b001666",
      "joined_text": "Additionally, critical ICT third-party service providers are subject to EU-level supervision and obliged to establish a subsidiary in the EU."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000025",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_other-laws-and-regulations-that-impact-organizations_o000_l020_N000054",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_other-laws-and-regulations-that-impact-organizations_o000_l020_N000055",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b001687",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b001688",
      "joined_text": "The EU has a variety of laws that protect consumer rights and promote market fairness, including the Consumer Credit Directive, Mortgage Credit Directive, Payment Service Directive, Markets in Financial Instruments Directive, and Markets in Crypto Assets Regulation."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000026",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_other-laws-and-regulations-that-impact-organizations_o020_l020_N000017",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_other-laws-and-regulations-that-impact-organizations_o020_l020_N000018",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b001697",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b001698",
      "joined_text": "Emphasizing human oversight, transparency, nondiscrimination, and accountability, this Act applies to AI systems and tools in service in the EU regardless of where the deployer or provider is located."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000027",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_other-laws-and-regulations-that-impact-organizations_o020_l020_N000044",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_other-laws-and-regulations-that-impact-organizations_o020_l020_N000045",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b001708",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b001709",
      "joined_text": "The risk-based approach helps organizations prioritize resources, focus, and efforts on high-risk areas, such as industries with very high carbon emissions or locations vulnerable to human rights violations."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000028",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_using-reports-guidance-notes-and-policy-papers-in-your-aml-cft-controls_o000_l020_N000013",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_using-reports-guidance-notes-and-policy-papers-in-your-aml-cft-controls_o000_l020_N000014",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b001739",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b001740",
      "joined_text": "For example, imagine that a relevant authority issues a report describing a product as high risk and your organization provides this product."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000029",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_cooperation-between-authorities_o000_l020_N000025",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_cooperation-between-authorities_o000_l020_N000026",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b001785",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b001786",
      "joined_text": "The group established sham companies and then opened US bank accounts in the names of those companies to receive and launder the victims' payments."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000030",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_cooperation-between-authorities_o020_l020_N000029",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_cooperation-between-authorities_o020_l020_N000030",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b001821",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b001822",
      "joined_text": "For example, agreements between the US and the Caribbean do not cover US tax evasion, so they are ineffective when applied to Caribbean jurisdictions, which are often tax havens."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000031",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_cooperation-involving-the-private-sector_o000_l020_N000019",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_cooperation-involving-the-private-sector_o000_l020_N000020",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b001842",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b001843",
      "joined_text": "They tracked transactions across international borders and digital environments to identify suspicious transactions linked to crime."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000032",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_cooperation-involving-the-private-sector_o000_l020_N000038",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_cooperation-involving-the-private-sector_o000_l020_N000039",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b001858",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b001859",
      "joined_text": "For example, if Bank A suspects money laundering from a customer, it might offboard them."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000033",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_introduction_o000_l020_N000006",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_introduction_o000_l020_N000007",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b001879",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b001880",
      "joined_text": "TD Bank failed to maintain an adequate BSA/AML compliance program, had insufficient risk assessment and CDD, inadequate transaction monitoring systems, and deficient suspicious activity reporting processes."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000034",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_three-lines-of-defense_o020_l020_N000029",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_three-lines-of-defense_o020_l020_N000030",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b002026",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b002027",
      "joined_text": "By maintaining these checks and balances at each LOD, organizations can identify weaknesses and enhance their AFC compliance programs, mitigating financial crime risks."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000035",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_three-lines-of-defense_o020_l020_N000032",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_three-lines-of-defense_o040_l020_N000001",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b002035",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b002036",
      "joined_text": "This tension arises from the built-in checks and challenges that characterize the three lines of defense model."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000036",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_three-lines-of-defense_o040_l020_N000007",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_three-lines-of-defense_o040_l020_N000008",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b002044",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b002045",
      "joined_text": "The board should establish a dedicated AML or risk management committee with knowledgeable members to monitor implementation, review policies, and ensure adequate resources for compliance."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000037",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_second-lod-s-afc-role-and-its-interaction-with-the-front-office_o000_l020_N000011",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_second-lod-s-afc-role-and-its-interaction-with-the-front-office_o000_l020_N000012",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b002067",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b002068",
      "joined_text": "HR ensures employees are trained in compliance and risk management policies, and understand their roles in mitigating risks, including those related to AML/CFT."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000038",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_types-of-risk-assessment_o020_l020_N000017",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_types-of-risk-assessment_o020_l020_N000018",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b002137",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b002138",
      "joined_text": "It should include key background information and assumptions, strategic and financial plans, and quantitative measures that translate into risk limits."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000039",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_enterprise-wide-risk-assessment_o020_l020_N000002",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_enterprise-wide-risk-assessment_o020_l020_N000003",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b002195",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b002196",
      "joined_text": "Design effectiveness evaluates whether the control is appropriately built for mitigating inherent risk."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000040",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_enterprise-wide-risk-assessment_o020_l020_N000019",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_enterprise-wide-risk-assessment_o020_l020_N000020",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b002200",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b002201",
      "joined_text": "Ideally, the action plan would include a response strategy, such as additional monitoring or limiting transaction, in case the risk escalates."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000041",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_enterprise-wide-risk-assessment_o020_l020_N000045",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_enterprise-wide-risk-assessment_o020_l020_N000046",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b002215",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b002216",
      "joined_text": "Senior management can meaningfully utilize the report to determine where to attribute staffing, resources, technology, and training to further mitigate risk."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000042",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_onboarding-afc-controls_o000_l020_N000019",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_onboarding-afc-controls_o000_l020_N000020",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b002418",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b002419",
      "joined_text": "The organization must screen each transaction the customer carries out to detect any sanctions exposure."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000043",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_ongoing-afc-controls_o000_l020_N000014",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_ongoing-afc-controls_o000_l020_N000015",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b002541",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b002542",
      "joined_text": "Such information might include financial institutions involved, sending and receiving parties, amounts, dates, currencies, address, and free text information."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000044",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_ongoing-afc-controls_o000_l020_N000031",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_ongoing-afc-controls_o000_l020_N000032",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b002566",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b002567",
      "joined_text": "Note that some jurisdictions extend PEP classifications to family members and close associates because of their potential indirect involvement in financial crimes."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000045",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_transaction-monitoring_o000_l020_N000031",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_transaction-monitoring_o000_l020_N000032",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b002638",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b002639",
      "joined_text": "Actively monitoring technology developments will help them adopt effective solutions, enhance detection, and adapt to emerging fraud and money laundering risks."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000046",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_transaction-monitoring_o020_l020_N000011",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_transaction-monitoring_o020_l020_N000012",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b002677",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b002678",
      "joined_text": "Senior analysts or compliance officers conduct this comprehensive assessment, which might include cross-department collaboration, complex risk assessments, and intricate analysis of transaction networks."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000047",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_transaction-monitoring_o040_l020_N000016",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_transaction-monitoring_o040_l020_N000017",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b002730",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b002731",
      "joined_text": "Customers are often wary of giving out personal information because they believe it will be used for marketing, resold, or otherwise compromised."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000048",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_concluding-an-investigation-and-suspicious-activity-reporting_o000_l020_N000022",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_concluding-an-investigation-and-suspicious-activity-reporting_o000_l020_N000023",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b002800",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b002801",
      "joined_text": "If the facts indicate an external report must be made, the most usual action is the submission of a suspicious activity report to the relevant authority in the jurisdiction."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000049",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_concluding-an-investigation-and-suspicious-activity-reporting_o000_l020_N000040",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_concluding-an-investigation-and-suspicious-activity-reporting_o000_l020_N000041",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b002805",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b002806",
      "joined_text": "The information in a SAR must be appropriate, complete, and factual."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000050",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_concluding-an-investigation-and-suspicious-activity-reporting_o040_l020_N000006",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_concluding-an-investigation-and-suspicious-activity-reporting_o040_l020_N000007",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b002858",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b002859",
      "joined_text": "This process should also be documented."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000051",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_concluding-an-investigation-and-suspicious-activity-reporting_o040_l020_N000044",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_concluding-an-investigation-and-suspicious-activity-reporting_o040_l020_N000045",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b002885",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b002886",
      "joined_text": "This is especially the case when dealing with complex law enforcement requests that might require coordination from many facets of the organization."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000052",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_concluding-an-investigation-and-suspicious-activity-reporting_o060_l020_N000028",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_concluding-an-investigation-and-suspicious-activity-reporting_o060_l020_N000029",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b002897",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b002898",
      "joined_text": "Provided there is no legal requirement for you to do otherwise, you must give your customer reasonable time to make other arrangements."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000053",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_concluding-an-investigation-and-suspicious-activity-reporting_o060_l020_N000046",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_concluding-an-investigation-and-suspicious-activity-reporting_o060_l020_N000047",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b002914",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b002915",
      "joined_text": "By improving access to services, financial institutions can help foster economic growth, enabling individuals to save, invest, and manage risks, thereby improving society as the whole."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000054",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_understanding-afc-technology_o000_l020_N000038",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_understanding-afc-technology_o000_l020_N000039",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b002962",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b002963",
      "joined_text": "This article provides a good reminder that organizations need to follow the risk assessment fundamentals and sound technology implementation principles to gain advantages from innovative technology."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000055",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_understanding-afc-technology_o020_l020_N000022",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_understanding-afc-technology_o020_l020_N000023",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b003000",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b003001",
      "joined_text": "Before committing to a full system replacement, organizations may consider augmentation."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000056",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_understanding-afc-technology_o040_l020_N000007",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_understanding-afc-technology_o040_l020_N000008",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b003014",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b003015",
      "joined_text": "Next-generation technologies, such as machine learning and other forms of AI, can enhance detection capabilities, streamline operations, and reduce false positives."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000057",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_understanding-afc-technology_o080_l020_N000012",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_understanding-afc-technology_o080_l020_N000013",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b003066",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b003067",
      "joined_text": "These technologies enable secure data analysis and information sharing while preserving privacy and regulatory compliance, ensuring that AFC efforts remain effective without compromising personal data protection."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000058",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_technology-and-tools-used-across-the-customer-life-cycle_o000_l020_N000018",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_technology-and-tools-used-across-the-customer-life-cycle_o000_l020_N000019",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b003091",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b003092",
      "joined_text": "For instance, the Federal Financial Institutions Examination Council's (FFIEC) red flag, “Customer makes multiple and frequent currency deposits to various accounts that are purportedly unrelated,” can be translated in an online context as “Customer initiates multiple and frequent transactions to unrelated accounts using the same device.”"
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000059",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_technology-and-tools-used-across-the-customer-life-cycle_o000_l020_N000022",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_technology-and-tools-used-across-the-customer-life-cycle_o000_l020_N000023",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b003094",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b003095",
      "joined_text": "Robotic process automation (RPA) is the use of robots, or \"bots,\" to automatically perform repeated processes and procedures."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000060",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_technology-and-tools-used-across-the-customer-life-cycle_o000_l020_N000036",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_technology-and-tools-used-across-the-customer-life-cycle_o000_l020_N000037",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b003097",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b003098",
      "joined_text": "While RPA can bring significant efficiency and scalability benefits, careless implementation can lead to serious legal and reputational consequences."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000061",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_technology-for-ongoing-monitoring-and-investigations_o000_l020_N000007",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_technology-for-ongoing-monitoring-and-investigations_o000_l020_N000008",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b003286",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b003287",
      "joined_text": "He notes that the current system has limitations in fuzzy logic matching."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000062",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_technology-for-payment-and-batch-screening_o020_l020_N000050",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_technology-for-payment-and-batch-screening_o040_l020_N000001",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b003367",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b003368",
      "joined_text": "Monitoring scenarios should also address suspicious transaction behaviors, including large cash deposits, frequent structuring (or \"smurfing\"), rapid fund movement between accounts, and cross-border transactions to high-risk regions."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000063",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_transaction-monitoring-scenario-calibration-testing_o020_l020_N000015",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_transaction-monitoring-scenario-calibration-testing_o020_l020_N000016",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b003410",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b003411",
      "joined_text": "AI-driven models require additional documentation covering training data, feature selection, bias mitigation strategies, and explainability metrics to demonstrate compliance with AML regulations."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000064",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_transaction-monitoring-scenario-calibration-testing_o040_l020_N000009",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_transaction-monitoring-scenario-calibration-testing_o040_l020_N000010",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b003433",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b003434",
      "joined_text": "Distributed ledger technology is a decentralized secure database system in which multiple participants share access without a central authority."
    },
    {
      "join_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_join_N000065",
      "left_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_transaction-monitoring-scenario-calibration-testing_o060_l020_N000005",
      "right_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_transaction-monitoring-scenario-calibration-testing_o060_l020_N000006",
      "left_block_id": "v7en_b003458",
      "right_block_id": "v7en_b003459",
      "joined_text": "She also assesses the data’s compatibility with existing formats and the system’s processing capacity."
    }
  ],
  "remainder_records": [
    {
      "remainder_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_remainder_N000001",
      "source_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_money-laundering-risks-associated-with-msbs-payment-service-providers-and-ecommerce_o000_l020_N000028",
      "sentence_id": "v7en_b000735_s001",
      "text": "Historically, MSBs were mainly used to serve individual customers’ crossborder transactions more quickly and cheaply."
    },
    {
      "remainder_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_remainder_N000002",
      "source_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_money-laundering-risks-associated-with-cryptoassets-and-other-fintechs_o000_l020_N000037",
      "sentence_id": "v7en_b000887_s002",
      "text": "Poor oversight and implementation could allow criminals to exploit vulnerabilities in the payment system."
    },
    {
      "remainder_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_remainder_N000003",
      "source_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_high-risk-business-sectors_o020_l020_N000005",
      "sentence_id": "v7en_b001023_s002",
      "text": "As a result, the value is transferred overseas, and the currency is converted without involving a bank or money services business (MSB)."
    },
    {
      "remainder_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_remainder_N000004",
      "source_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_global-afc-frameworks-governance-and-regulations_o000_l020_N000018",
      "sentence_id": "v7en_b001098_s001",
      "text": "Today, multiple international organizations, such as FATF, Basel Committee on Banking Supervision, and Wolfsberg Group, continue to shape financial crime compliance standards."
    },
    {
      "remainder_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_remainder_N000005",
      "source_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_financial-action-task-force_o040_l020_N000014",
      "sentence_id": "v7en_b001196_s001",
      "text": "According to FATF’s website, all jurisdictions are subject to post-assessment monitoring."
    },
    {
      "remainder_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_remainder_N000006",
      "source_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_cooperation-involving-the-private-sector_o000_l020_N000019",
      "sentence_id": "v7en_b001842_s001",
      "text": "The Fintel Alliance and private industry partners provided collaborative financial analysis to support this case."
    },
    {
      "remainder_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_remainder_N000007",
      "source_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_cooperation-involving-the-private-sector_o000_l020_N000020",
      "sentence_id": "v7en_b001843_s002",
      "text": "Their analysis enabled the AFP to fully identify and comprehensively dismantle the transnational syndicate’s financial structures."
    },
    {
      "remainder_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_remainder_N000008",
      "source_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_second-lod-s-afc-role-and-its-interaction-with-the-front-office_o000_l020_N000011",
      "sentence_id": "v7en_b002067_s003",
      "text": "They ensure staff understand their roles in mitigating risks, including those related to AML/CFT."
    },
    {
      "remainder_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_remainder_N000009",
      "source_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_onboarding-afc-controls_o000_l020_N000020",
      "sentence_id": "v7en_b002419_s002",
      "text": "If it detects such exposure, the organization blocks payments and escalates to establish further steps."
    },
    {
      "remainder_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_remainder_N000010",
      "source_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_concluding-an-investigation-and-suspicious-activity-reporting_o000_l020_N000041",
      "sentence_id": "v7en_b002806_s002",
      "text": "You should include information about the customer, services offered by the institution, transaction activity, rationale for suspicions, and any supporting evidence."
    },
    {
      "remainder_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_remainder_N000011",
      "source_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_concluding-an-investigation-and-suspicious-activity-reporting_o040_l020_N000007",
      "sentence_id": "v7en_b002859_s002",
      "text": "Additionally, update the client file with all investigation-related documentation."
    },
    {
      "remainder_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_remainder_N000012",
      "source_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_understanding-afc-technology_o020_l020_N000023",
      "sentence_id": "v7en_b003001_s002",
      "text": "For example, they might consider enhancing existing systems with new capabilities, thereby reducing immediate cost and disruption while still improving effectiveness."
    },
    {
      "remainder_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_remainder_N000013",
      "source_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_technology-for-ongoing-monitoring-and-investigations_o000_l020_N000007",
      "sentence_id": "v7en_b003286_s001",
      "text": "Marco performs an assessment to identify gaps in the current screening system."
    },
    {
      "remainder_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_remainder_N000014",
      "source_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_technology-for-ongoing-monitoring-and-investigations_o000_l020_N000008",
      "sentence_id": "v7en_b003287_s002",
      "text": "In addition, the system cannot handle different languages consistently."
    },
    {
      "remainder_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_remainder_N000015",
      "source_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_technology-for-ongoing-monitoring-and-investigations_o000_l020_N000008",
      "sentence_id": "v7en_b003287_s003",
      "text": "Therefore, the system generates a large volume of false positive alerts on customers with “Muhammad” in their name."
    },
    {
      "remainder_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_remainder_N000016",
      "source_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_transaction-monitoring-scenario-calibration-testing_o040_l020_N000010",
      "sentence_id": "v7en_b003434_s002",
      "text": "Blockchain is its most prominent form."
    },
    {
      "remainder_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_prefreeze_crossblock_remainder_N000017",
      "source_unit_id": "v7u_tmp_pilot_v2fb_transaction-monitoring-scenario-calibration-testing_o060_l020_N000006",
      "sentence_id": "v7en_b003459_s002",
      "text": "This ensures that additional data fields enhance detection without overwhelming resources or generating excessive false positives."
    }
  ],
